  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase" ADogSaidBody="LegsTail">
    <defName>RSW_Devourers</defName>
    <label>devourer</label>
    <description>Devourers were carnivorous anthropoids twisted by the dark side of the Force that were indigenous to jungle moon of Dxun. Devourers were known across many worlds for having attacked (and in some instances killed) several notable figures in galactic history who wandered into their territory. They were fierce creatures and were sometimes exported as attack animals to other worlds where escaped specimens easily established themselves in the local ecosystems.</description>
